 "ai_methods_detail": [
  "Artificial neural network predicting instantaneous PV electricity production",
  "Multilayer deep neural network (DeepLearning4J, Xavier initialisation, MSE loss, best with 8 hidden nodes); polynomial regression (called ML by authors, coded statistical)",
  "Feed-forward backpropagation ANN modelling pump flow rate as a function of input power and total head, trained on manufacturer performance curves, coupled to I-V/MPPT PV model",
  "K-means clustering for farmland detection from satellite imagery",
  "CNN (TensorFlow, Adam optimizer) for tomato leaf disease classification from PiCam images; actuators controlled by threshold rules",
  "Artificial neural network (ANN) combined with genetic algorithm (GA)",
  "Random Forest Regression, Gradient Boosted Trees, Support Vector Regression, Linear Regression trained on CFD simulation data; dual annealing optimization applied to the GBT model",
  "Unspecified machine-learning model using panel-layout features to forecast shaded insolation (algorithm not named in abstract)",
  "unspecified machine learning regression surrogate trained on outputs of an in-house physics-based crop-PV model (algorithm not named in abstract)",
  "GRU (gated recurrent unit) hybridised with AdaBoost for classification of crop health and solar panel condition; cosine-similarity redundancy elimination for data aggregation",
  "Support vector machine (SVM) and decision tree (DT) regression for crop yield forecasting",
  "CNN-BiGRU-Attention hybrid deep learning model tuned with the TTAO metaheuristic optimizer; benchmarked against 9 comparison models",
  "GWO-optimised BP (back-propagation) neural network for greenhouse temperature forecasting; APSO-optimised fuzzy PID temperature controller",
  "Transformer, Informer, Pyraformer, TimesNet (transformer-based time-series forecasting models)",
  "CNN transfer learning with pre-trained EfficientNetV2L, EfficientNetV2M and ResNet50 (Keras) for chili crop counting and harvest prediction",
  "Random Forest PV-output predictor per louvre angle; Q-learning louvre-angle agent; SVM classifier and MLP regression for microclimate stability; K-means and Isolation Forest for plant-health anomalies; ARIMA early-warning risk (statistical)",
  "k-medoids clustering (MATLAB, elbow method for k) to group ground insolation profiles; unsupervised classical ML used only for scenario reduction",
  "Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) artificial neural network",
  "Conv1D and MaxPooling feature extraction with a modified spiking neural network (Adaptive Exponential Integrate-and-Fire, SNN-AdEx) classifier; Euclidean distance threshold for redundancy filtering; compared against MLEM, MLELMAKF, SOF-SVM and MRMR-KNN baselines",
  "U-Net fully convolutional surrogate trained with combined L1 and adversarial (GAN discriminator) loss on Radiance/Accelerad raytracing outputs; k-means clustering to sample weather data",
  "Artificial Neural Network (ANN), Gaussian Process Regression (GPR), Linear Regression (LR), Decision Tree (DT), Support Vector Machine (SVM)",
  "M-MDNet deep segmentation network: multi-layer multi-scale window attention backbone (M-MWA), enhanced ASPP, scSE attention",
  "Principal component analysis; K-means clustering (supervised yield prediction attempted but limited by label sparsity)",
  "MLP, CNN, ResNet (deep learning) for residual heat prediction",
  "Simple RNN (two 50-unit layers, dropout); directed spatio-temporal GNN combining a 4-head graph attention network (GAT) with LSTM; Adam optimiser, MSE loss, 96-step input window",
  "VMD_IMF12-Informer-BiLSTM (variational mode decomposition combined with Informer transformer and bidirectional LSTM), benchmarked against 8 other prediction methods",
  "AI-assisted surrogate model (algorithm not named in abstract) combined with evolutionary multi-objective optimization producing Pareto-optimal solutions",
  "Bayesian-optimized (Optuna TPE) sequence-to-sequence LSTM; benchmarks LightGBM, CNN-LSTM, TCN, SARIMA/SARIMAX, persistence",
  "U-Net++ (EfficientNet-B0 encoder) and DeepLabv3+ canopy segmentation; EfficientNet-B0/B2/B3 stress classification with focal loss; ResNet-34 CNN LAI regression; HRNet/Keypoint R-CNN height; Mask R-CNN leaf counting; YOLOv8-s/Faster R-CNN fruit detection; Grad-CAM",
  "Kriging (Gaussian process) surrogate models of ray-tracing/physics PV and APSIM soybean simulations, with NSGA-II multi-objective optimization",
  "Random Forest, Histogram Gradient Boosting, XGBoost with feature importance and partial dependence plots; multiple linear regression baseline",
  "Stacked ensemble of XGBoost and CatBoost (gradient boosting), SHAP for interpretability",
  "k-means clustering of respiration rate classes; PCA plus XGBoost to predict respiration rate and build a hybrid heat stress index; Bayesian Ridge Regression for heat stress class transition probabilities",
  "Random Forest and Artificial Neural Network for crop yield and energy prediction; multi-objective optimization (method not named)",
  "COCO-pretrained YOLOv8 (Ultralytics) for apple detection, applied without fine-tuning; SIFT coregistration and rule-based HSV red-pixel colour analysis; Mann-Whitney U and Fisher tests",
  "Machine learning surrogate models (algorithm not named in abstract) trained on CFD simulations to estimate convection and air temperature",
  "Random Forest, Decision Tree, KNN, SVR, XGBoost, CatBoost, LightGBM, LSTM, SHAP interpretation, and a proposed SHAP-Guided Stacked Ensemble-LSTM (SG-SEL) hybrid",
  "Bayesian Regularization neural network (MATLAB) trained on NSRDB climatic data to impute missing soil moisture data; yield model itself is linear regression on a compound irradiance-soil moisture variable",
  "Unspecified machine learning techniques for forecasting PV generation and water availability from GCM outputs (algorithms not named in abstract); NSGA-II for multi-objective optimization (not AI)",
  "ResNet-50 classifier, DeepLabV3+ segmentation, U-Net shadow canonization with FiLM conditioning on PV geometry and sun priors, federated prototype contrastive learning (InfoNCE), FedAvg with secure aggregation and differential privacy",
  "Dual attention mechanism-based quantum LSTM (DAM-QLSTM) for forecasting; variational quantum circuit (VQC) based rolling optimization for scheduling",
  "LSTM-Attention (main model), compared with standard LSTM, LSTM-GRU, BP neural network and SVM; Pearson correlation for feature selection",
  "Physics-informed explainable AI framework with SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations) feature attribution on a learned model of the Light Stability Index; the underlying ML model is not named in the abstract",
  "MobileNetV2-based CNN regression for leaf counts; U-Net segmentation refinement; pseudo-labeling"
 ],
